{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771270/extras/e2be03acce47e8b07c9d89e5d937f631.poster.avif?t=1761662280\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771270/extras/e2be03acce47e8b07c9d89e5d937f631.webm?t=1761662280\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771270/extras/e2be03acce47e8b07c9d89e5d937f631.mp4?t=1761662280\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Red Panda: The Quiet Path</strong> is a charming, atmospheric third\u2011person adventure where you play as a red panda exploring a scenic, tranquil forest.<br>No words, no combat, no rush\u2014just nature, silence, and a path that unfolds step by step. Immerse yourself in a meditative journey where the experience matters more than the destination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong><br> \ud83c\udf33 <strong>Atmospheric world</strong> \u2014 Explore a bright and cozy forest filled with natural sounds, soft colors, hidden trails, and unexpected discoveries.<br> \ud83e\udded <strong>Story without words</strong> \u2014 Everything is conveyed through the environment, visual storytelling, and sound. No text \u2014 only emotion and full immersion.<br> \ud83d\udc3c <strong>Panda abilities</strong> \u2014 Climb trees, roll, swim across rivers, knock down objects, and even fly with a balloon.<br> \ud83e\udde9 <strong>Gentle quests</strong> \u2014 Small, optional tasks gently guide your exploration and unveil new corners of the world.<br> \ud83d\uddfa\ufe0f <strong>Relaxed pacing</strong> \u2014 No pressure, no urgency. Go at your rhythm.<br> \ud83c\udfae <strong>Perfect for short sessions</strong> \u2014 A great way to relax and escape into a cozy forest world for a while.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771270/extras/200ac1672ad6f68cad9f73af4bbfa27c.poster.avif?t=1761662280\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771270/extras/200ac1672ad6f68cad9f73af4bbfa27c.webm?t=1761662280\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771270/extras/200ac1672ad6f68cad9f73af4bbfa27c.mp4?t=1761662280\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"First Steps","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3771270/bf842aa83a3acfa64d7fae64e60927973feb012d.jpg"},{"name":"Explorer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3771270/ef5207a7ecfd6f2b735ba64b88a6973d575a2ea1.jpg"},{"name":"Guardian","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3771270/785d5e42e6943b12e5080e947fe7212637cf5768.jpg"},{"name":"Secret Value","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3771270/341caa8ea685d230b3ff55a95504d05ae1bf3f23.jpg"},{"name":"Perfect Balance","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3771270/7f23d051d89bb2a55a9c8dcdb31974cf3d337900.jpg"},{"name":"Ball of Fluff","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3771270/020f7c9a7b3905c0e3356e7767aa35dc3cca10f9.jpg"},{"name":"Curious Panda","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3771270/2056cdb3c67e31213932bf2585f056638d772f20.jpg"},{"name":"Playful Spirit","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3771270/cb07f9820b6c2fb8b6a4a3756bce926fe3c38249.jpg"},{"name":"Tree Climber","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/